# Internal engineering working papers.
#
# docs/AUDIT-*.md and docs/REVIEW-*.md are dated working documents: an inventory of
# unpatched weaknesses in *live* hospital systems (the shared-PIN signing path, an
# unauthenticated Orthanc API, an ungoverned AI entry point) written for the people
# fixing them. They are not release documentation, and publishing a roadmap to a
# system that is still exposed helps the wrong reader. They stay on the working
# machine until the findings they list are closed, at which point the closed items
# move into docs/security/ as ordinary threat-model history.
docs/AUDIT-*.md
docs/REVIEW-*.md
